Package: codedeck
Version: 1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Bert Speckels <skrrytch@speckels.net>
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/bespex/CodeDeck
Depends: codeck
Recommends: marq, dirq, jayq
Description: CodeDeck with everything it works with
 CodeDeck runs beside your AI coding sessions: it shows what each session is
 doing and what it changed, keeps a snapshot before every turn to go back to,
 and attaches exactly what you choose to your next prompt. The program itself
 is codeck.
 .
 This package installs codeck and the Qiew viewers CodeDeck opens things in:
 Marq for a turn's report, Dirq for diffs and comparisons, Jayq for JSON. Any
 of the viewers can be removed on its own.
